{"id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-curry-howard.md","title":"Curry-Howard Correspondence","display":"df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-curry-howard","aliases":["72-df-curry-howard"],"display":"df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence","depends_on":["[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","[[72-df-system-f]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.3 §3.2 print15–17; ch.11 §11.6 print93","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-curry-howard"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-curry-howard</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.3 §3.2 print15–17; ch.11 §11.6 print93"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-curry-howard-—-Curry–Howard-Correspondence\">df-curry-howard — Curry–Howard Correspondence</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\">\\(s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\\)</span>；类型、项与类型代入分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a>。命题语法就是相应类型语法，原子与类型变量逐一同名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是变量标记假设的有限偏函数。</li>\n<li>最后四式固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span>，并将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\approx_{s,\\Gamma,A}\">\\(\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\approx_{s,\\Gamma,A}\\)</span> 局部简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_s,\\epsilon_s,\\approx_s\">\\(\\delta_s,\\epsilon_s,\\approx_s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 在最后四式遍历所选证明语法的单孔树context；所有实例要求两端属于同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下列证明语法为有限自由树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,i,e,I,E\">\\(a,i,e,I,E\\)</span> 是互异构造标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i(x,A,d)\">\\(i(x,A,d)\\)</span> 绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(U,d)\">\\(I(U,d)\\)</span> 绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，按绑定变量改名取α类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_s^D\">\\(U_s^D\\)</span> 是合法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\\)</span> 的编码集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>。各规则中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,e\\in\\mathcal D_s\">\\(d,e\\in\\mathcal D_s\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_F\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\)</span> 分别取各自语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{b,s}^D\">\\(R_{b,s}^D\\)</span> 的三个图式分别在该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的全部合法对象上实例化。System F专有的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,E\">\\(I,E\\)</span> 不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\to\">\\(s=\\to\\)</span> 的语法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_\\to&amp;::=a(x)\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal D_\\to)\\mid e(\\mathcal D_\\to,\\mathcal D_\\to),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_F&amp;::=a(x)\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid e(\\mathcal D_F,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid I(U,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid E(\\mathcal D_F,A),\\\\\nR_{b,s}^D&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash a(x):A}:\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash i(x,A,d):A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash e(d,e):B}\\right\\},\\\\\nR_\\to^D&amp;:=R_{b,\\to}^D,\\qquad R_F^D:=R_{b,F}^D\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash I(U,d):\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash E(d,B):A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)&amp;:=\\{d:\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_s^D}(R_s^D)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(a(x))&amp;:=x,&amp;\\operatorname{CH}(i(x,A,d))&amp;:=\\lambda x:A.\\operatorname{CH}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(e(d,e))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}(d)\\operatorname{CH}(e),&amp;\\operatorname{CH}(I(U,d))&amp;:=\\Lambda U.\\operatorname{CH}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(E(d,B))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B],\\\\\nJ(x)&amp;:=a(x),&amp;J(\\lambda x:A.M)&amp;:=i(x,A,J(M)),&amp;J(MN)&amp;:=e(J(M),J(N)),\\\\\nJ(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=I(U,J(M)),&amp;J(M[B])&amp;:=E(J(M),B),\\\\\nd[e/x]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[\\operatorname{CH}(e)/x]),&amp;d[B/U]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B/U]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_\\to&amp;::=a(x)\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal D_\\to)\\mid e(\\mathcal D_\\to,\\mathcal D_\\to),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_F&amp;::=a(x)\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid e(\\mathcal D_F,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid I(U,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid E(\\mathcal D_F,A),\\\\\nR_{b,s}^D&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash a(x):A}:\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash i(x,A,d):A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash e(d,e):B}\\right\\},\\\\\nR_\\to^D&amp;:=R_{b,\\to}^D,\\qquad R_F^D:=R_{b,F}^D\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash I(U,d):\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash E(d,B):A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)&amp;:=\\{d:\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_s^D}(R_s^D)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(a(x))&amp;:=x,&amp;\\operatorname{CH}(i(x,A,d))&amp;:=\\lambda x:A.\\operatorname{CH}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(e(d,e))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}(d)\\operatorname{CH}(e),&amp;\\operatorname{CH}(I(U,d))&amp;:=\\Lambda U.\\operatorname{CH}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(E(d,B))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B],\\\\\nJ(x)&amp;:=a(x),&amp;J(\\lambda x:A.M)&amp;:=i(x,A,J(M)),&amp;J(MN)&amp;:=e(J(M),J(N)),\\\\\nJ(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=I(U,J(M)),&amp;J(M[B])&amp;:=E(J(M),B),\\\\\nd[e/x]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[\\operatorname{CH}(e)/x]),&amp;d[B/U]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B/U]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[e(i(x,A,d),f)],C[d[f/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[E(I(U,d),B)],C[d[B/U]]\\rangle:s=F\\},\\\\\n\\epsilon_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[i(x,A,e(d,a(x)))],C[d]\\rangle:x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[I(U,E(d,U))],C[d]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\},\\\\\n\\approx_s&amp;:=(\\delta_s\\cup\\epsilon_s\\cup\\delta_s^{-1}\\cup\\epsilon_s^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[e(i(x,A,d),f)],C[d[f/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[E(I(U,d),B)],C[d[B/U]]\\rangle:s=F\\},\\\\\n\\epsilon_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[i(x,A,e(d,a(x)))],C[d]\\rangle:x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[I(U,E(d,U))],C[d]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\},\\\\\n\\approx_s&amp;:=(\\delta_s\\cup\\epsilon_s\\cup\\delta_s^{-1}\\cup\\epsilon_s^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造项在此就是带变量标记、固定上下文约定的自然演绎树编码；不存在额外“Realize”原语。J与CH的有限树递归直接互逆，故用于定义证明代入不循环。→规则只对应最小直觉主义蕴含片段；F另含二阶命题全称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-curry-howard-—-Curry–Howard-Correspondence","text":"df-curry-howard — Curry–Howard Correspondence","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-f]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；类型、项与类型代入分别使用 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]、[[72-df-system-f]]。命题语法就是相应类型语法，原子与类型变量逐一同名。$\\Gamma$ 是变量标记假设的有限偏函数。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；类型、项与类型代入分别使用 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]、[[72-df-system-f]]。命题语法就是相应类型语法，原子与类型变量逐一同名。$\\Gamma$ 是变量标记假设的有限偏函数。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下列证明语法为有限自由树，$a,i,e,I,E$ 是互异构造标签；$i(x,A,d)$ 绑定 $x$，$I(U,d)$ 绑定 $U$，按绑定变量改名取α类。$U_s^D$ 是合法 $\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle$ 的编码集；$\\operatorname{Cl}$ 使用 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]。各规则中的 $A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s$、$d,e\\in\\mathcal D_s$，$\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$ 与 $\\mathsf{Ty}_F$ 分别取各自语法；$R_{b,s}^D$ 的三个图式分别在该 $s$ 的全部合法对象上实例化。System F专有的 $I,E$ 不属于 $s=\\to$ 的语法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,A","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\approx_{s,\\Gamma,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_s,\\epsilon_s,\\approx_s","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"a,i,e,I,E","display":false},{"tex":"i(x,A,d)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"I(U,d)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U_s^D","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s","display":false},{"tex":"d,e\\in\\mathcal D_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_F","display":false},{"tex":"R_{b,s}^D","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"I,E","display":false},{"tex":"s=\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_\\to&::=a(x)\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal D_\\to)\\mid e(\\mathcal D_\\to,\\mathcal D_\\to),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_F&::=a(x)\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid e(\\mathcal D_F,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid I(U,\\mathcal D_F)\\mid E(\\mathcal D_F,A),\\\\\nR_{b,s}^D&:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash a(x):A}:\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash i(x,A,d):A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash e(d,e):B}\\right\\},\\\\\nR_\\to^D&:=R_{b,\\to}^D,\\qquad R_F^D:=R_{b,F}^D\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash I(U,d):\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash E(d,B):A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)&:=\\{d:\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_s^D}(R_s^D)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(a(x))&:=x,&\\operatorname{CH}(i(x,A,d))&:=\\lambda x:A.\\operatorname{CH}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(e(d,e))&:=\\operatorname{CH}(d)\\operatorname{CH}(e),&\\operatorname{CH}(I(U,d))&:=\\Lambda U.\\operatorname{CH}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}(E(d,B))&:=\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B],\\\\\nJ(x)&:=a(x),&J(\\lambda x:A.M)&:=i(x,A,J(M)),&J(MN)&:=e(J(M),J(N)),\\\\\nJ(\\Lambda U.M)&:=I(U,J(M)),&J(M[B])&:=E(J(M),B),\\\\\nd[e/x]&:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[\\operatorname{CH}(e)/x]),&d[B/U]&:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B/U]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_s&:=\\{\\langle C[e(i(x,A,d),f)],C[d[f/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[E(I(U,d),B)],C[d[B/U]]\\rangle:s=F\\},\\\\\n\\epsilon_s&:=\\{\\langle C[i(x,A,e(d,a(x)))],C[d]\\rangle:x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[I(U,E(d,U))],C[d]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\},\\\\\n\\approx_s&:=(\\delta_s\\cup\\epsilon_s\\cup\\delta_s^{-1}\\cup\\epsilon_s^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3989,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-curry-howard|df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence]]"},{"id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是证明对象的集合，$R\\subseteq X\\times X$ 为明确给定的一步归约关系；不预设其正规化或合流。用于类型化自然演绎时，$X$ 可取 [[72-df-curry-howard]] 的有限推导树，$R$ 取其中定义的 detour 归约。"},{"id":"e1876c63cf3f1fb2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-curry-howard]] 的证明语法与detour归约。$d\\in\\mathcal D_s$ 是一个有限构造树；树地址为 $o\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}$，根为 $\\langle\\rangle$。子树下标 $d|_o$ 按构造的证明子项排序：$i,I,E$ 各有一个证明子项，$e$ 有两个；类型注解不是证明子项。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-curry-howard|df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence]]"},{"id":"a07a3ec2073ac7ee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；$\\operatorname{Der}_s,\\operatorname{CH},J,\\approx_s$ 使用 [[72-df-curry-howard]]；$\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)=\\{M:\\Gamma\\vdash_sM:A\\}$。以下关系仅取同一类型、同一上下文的两端。"}],"outgoing":["e38d92d6727e7ead","a59aab1599221f4a","a77f51439d01d542"]}